rumc-crisis-epidemic-name = Epidemic
rumc-crisis-epidemic-desc = People are falling ill in the city. It needs doctors and clean water before the sickness spreads.
rumc-crisis-drought-name = Drought
rumc-crisis-drought-desc = The wells have run dry and the fields wither. The city will not hold out long without water.
rumc-crisis-famine-name = Famine
rumc-crisis-famine-desc = There is no food in the city. A store of supplies or a shipment will save the people.
rumc-crisis-raid-name = Raid
rumc-crisis-raid-desc = A gang has attacked the city. It needs help for the people before it gets worse.
rumc-crisis-fire-name = Fire
rumc-crisis-fire-desc = Part of the city is burning. The sooner help comes, the more is saved.
rumc-crisis-flood-name = Flood
rumc-crisis-flood-desc = Water has covered the lower quarters. People must be carried out, and the water pumped away.
rumc-crisis-collapse-name = Collapse
rumc-crisis-collapse-desc = A building or a mine has fallen in, and people are under the rubble. Rescuers are needed at once.

rumc-action-festival-name = City festival
rumc-action-festival-desc = A festival in the name of your faction. Cheap and noticed, and it can be held again only after a while.
rumc-action-water-name = Clean water
rumc-action-water-desc = Wells and water cleaning. While they work the city does not suffer from epidemics and droughts; if a drought is on, it ends.
rumc-action-rescue-name = Rescue operation
rumc-action-rescue-desc = Help after a raid, a fire, a flood or a collapse. The faster, the more influence. Only when the city is in trouble.
rumc-action-firefighting-name = Fighting fire and water
rumc-action-firefighting-desc = One-time help in a fire or a flood, the reward depends on speed. Only when the city is in trouble.
rumc-action-warehouse-name = Store of supplies
rumc-action-warehouse-desc = A store of food and medicine. It takes on two troubles (famine, epidemic, drought), and you get influence at once.
rumc-action-workcrew-name = Work crew
rumc-action-workcrew-desc = Workers on a building site of the city. Cheap and short, but it brings money to the budget while they work.
rumc-action-roads-name = Mending the roads
rumc-action-roads-desc = The roads of the city are whole, on the map too. Caravans go faster and bring money to the budget.
rumc-action-hospital-name = Doctors and a hospital
rumc-action-hospital-desc = A hospital keeps epidemics away from the city for a time; if an epidemic is on, it ends.
rumc-action-evacuation-name = Evacuation
rumc-action-evacuation-desc = Taking people out of a city in danger. A lot of influence for speed. Only when the city is in trouble.
rumc-action-school-name = School and teaching
rumc-action-school-desc = A school with teachers. Influence grows slowly but surely, and the trained workers bring money.
rumc-action-refugees-name = Taking in refugees
rumc-action-refugees-desc = You take in people from the stricken city. A sharp rise of influence, but they cost money while they live with you. Only when the city is in trouble.
rumc-action-power-name = Power and communications
rumc-action-power-desc = A generator and a relay. The city lives faster, and the budget gets a steady income.
rumc-action-fund-name = City fund
rumc-action-fund-desc = You put money into a common fund for a long time. It grows and pays back what you put in with interest, and the influence comes at once. You can put more in again.
rumc-action-quarter-name = Trade quarter
rumc-action-quarter-desc = A market and stores of your faction in the city. It brings a steady income, and the city grows rich.
rumc-city-ashport-name = Ashport
rumc-city-ashport-desc = A noisy port with a great market. Everything that comes by sea is unloaded here, and they bargain until evening.
rumc-city-redmoor-name = Redmoor
rumc-city-redmoor-desc = A city of gunsmiths among red hills. Arms are made to order here.
rumc-city-silverhold-name = Silverhold
rumc-city-silverhold-desc = A fortified city of bankers and scribes. They know the price of everything and remember it all.
rumc-city-blackwater-name = Blackwater
rumc-city-blackwater-desc = A dark cove without laws. What is not in the ports is bought and sold here.
rumc-city-goldspire-name = Goldspire
rumc-city-goldspire-desc = A city with a spire that is seen a day away. The caravans of all lands pass through it.
rumc-city-stormhaven-name = Stormhaven
rumc-city-stormhaven-desc = A naval port with yards. Ships are built, armed and sold here.
rumc-city-oldwell-name = Oldwell
rumc-city-oldwell-desc = An old city by a deep well. Travellers share their news here.
rumc-city-brightsands-name = Brightsands
rumc-city-brightsands-desc = A city on bright sands. An honest market by day, quite another by night.
rumc-city-ironhollow-name = Ironhollow
rumc-city-ironhollow-desc = A mining city in a deep hollow. Ore is smelted here, and guns are sold without questions.
rumc-map-road-name = { $from } — { $to }
rumc-map-road-desc-road = A road between { $from } and { $to }. Wagon trains go along it, the surest way.
rumc-map-road-desc-trail = A trail between { $from } and { $to }. It is walked light and quiet, and there are almost no duties on it.
rumc-map-road-desc-searoute = A sea route between { $from } and { $to }. Ships take long on it, but carry much.

rumc-map-point-limit = A faction may have no more than { $value } great buildings that bring points
rumc-action-embassy-name = Embassy
rumc-action-embassy-desc = A huge embassy building. Every 15 minutes it brings a point of influence with the mother faction while it stands. Very dear, and it needs strong influence in the city.
rumc-action-university-name = University
rumc-action-university-desc = A great university. It brings money to the budget and a point of influence with the mother faction every 15 minutes. Very dear.
rumc-action-congress-name = Palace of congresses
rumc-action-congress-desc = The greatest building of the colony. It keeps epidemics, droughts and famine away from the city and brings a point of influence with the mother faction every 15 minutes. Extremely dear.

rumc-map-shares = The reputation of the city is one scale shared by all the ambassadors:
rumc-map-share-line = { $faction }: { $value }
